# Cloud-sync conflict copies. OneDrive/iCloud append " 2" to a filename when it
# can't resolve a conflict. These are stale snapshots, never wanted, and files
# under src/ would otherwise be uploaded straight to the live site by
# `aws s3 sync src/` — traxent.io/privacy 2.html and friends.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
*[0-9] copy.*
* copy.*
